          "data": {
            "text/html": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert\"><h2 id=\"31-basic-formulation\">3.1 - Basic Formulation</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The voltage <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(v_i||)</marimo-tex> at the node <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(i||)</marimo-tex> must satisfy the limits <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\underline{v}_i \\le |v_i| \\le \\bar{v}_i||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span>"
